      "side": 1,
      "message": "The issue is a race condition, right now we only use `removeDirectory` but processes might continue trying to write to the emmc even while we are trying to unmount due to other bugs. This is mitigated when we mount `/mnt` as a 500K tmpfs partition since they will just quickly fill it but not harm the rest of the system. However it blocks the rest of the locking operation in estoraged for no good reason. This is trying to ignore those failures and continue locking.",
